// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// COMPANION B: failure drill-down with the query payload
// Description_s and Query_s carry the endpoint and the literal query string.
// Both are documented but neither appears in a published Microsoft sample, so
// treat their availability as UNVERIFIED until file 01 section 4 confirms it.
// This is the closest the Search tier gets to answering the customer's
// "the connector is a black box, we cannot see request payloads" complaint.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
